From: EasyMesh Lab
Subject: [PATCH] nbapi: release action parameter allocations on scope exit

Guard temporary variants in scan, BTM, spatial-reuse and VBSS actions so
success and early returns release their owned values. Own the independent
cstring returned by amxc_var_dyncast in get_param_string with a free deleter.
Action validation, requests and native reporting policy are unchanged.

diff --git a/controller/nbapi/on_action.cpp b/controller/nbapi/on_action.cpp
--- a/controller/nbapi/on_action.cpp
+++ b/controller/nbapi/on_action.cpp
@@ -11,16 +11,18 @@
